MODULE: BaselineOnlyAfterRepairWrongFingerprint
TARGET: BaselineOnlyAfterRepair
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: Repair completion banks a fingerprint other than the probed snapshot.
PERTURBS: CompleteRepair
--- FIND
    /\ baseline' = [baseline EXCEPT ![selected] = pendingBaseline[selected]]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: certify a version the completed repair never established.
    /\ baseline' = [baseline EXCEPT ![selected] = 1 - pendingBaseline[selected]]
--- END
